msgstr "CM4 koprocesor zamijenjen s Open-AMP *(alati)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:204
msgid ""
"The deprecated CM4 coprocessor firmware mechanism on GIGA / Nicla Vision / "
"Portenta H7 was removed and replaced by Open-AMP/RPMsg. Dual-core code must "
"move to the Open-AMP model (a vuart example is provided)."
msgstr ""
"Zastarjeli mehanizam ugrađenog programa (firmware) CM4 koprocesora na GIGA /"
" Nicla Vision / Portenta H7 uklonjen je i zamijenjen s Open-AMP/RPMsg. Kod "
"za dvije jezgre mora prijeći na Open-AMP model (priložen je vuart primjer)."

